@startuml
title Disconnect, and come back
actor "Dee" as dee
participant "Chat" as app
actor "Ada, Bob (have room:general open)" as room

dee -> app : disconnect
note right of app : Dee's session is kept (stored): her name and room.\nOnly what is derived from who is connected changes.
group derived again: a patch goes only where a value changed
  app -> room : patch room:general remove /members/Dee
  note over room : the lobby does not change: Ada and Bob are still in general
end
note right of app : her session is stored: when she connects again on this device, she is back in general
== later ==
dee -> app : connect
app --> dee : open session
app --> dee : open lobby
app --> dee : open room:general
group derived again: a patch goes only where a value changed
  app -> room : patch room:general add /members/Dee
end
note over app : a restart is everyone disconnecting at once: members and the lobby are empty\nuntil people connect again; sessions, rooms and messages are as they were
@enduml
